"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Register an immutable content-addressed custom type, reference one item, then mutate it through pm update; the extension can only detect the invalid write afterward"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A capability-gated public guard can atomically allow or deny every core item mutation with stable remediation"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Available hooks are post-commit or warning-only and cannot enforce invariants"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.8.1"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk/extensions/mutations"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-01T13:27:20.518Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-wwooxx","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-01T13:27:20.518Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-xm7c","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-01T13:27:20.518Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-01T13:27:20.518Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"text=Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for GH-854, pre-commit mutation guard, invariant veto, transaction hooks, and extension enforcement. Closed pm-xm7c supplies atomic mutation foundations; open pm-wwooxx governs secret-rule consistency, not package-defined domain invariants. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/854"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"cf029034ef679d786e01f5fa3f296057f4d308ffc88be78d1bab6e4b723833bf","message":"Track GH-854 public transactional extension invariant guard"}
